	(descr "USB-C receptacle TYPE-C-31-M-12 (LCSC C165948, HRO Hroparts datasheet 2205251630). Wide GND/VBUS pads (A1B12, A4B9, B4A9, B1A12) narrowed by 0.05mm off each pad's outer edge only (centre, 1.30mm length, and the other 12 pads untouched): the as-pulled easyeda2kicad polygon carried a spurious 0.1mm outline stroke that inflated each wide pad from the vendor's own 0.60mm recommended width to an effective 0.70mm, closing the GND-VBUS gap to 0.100mm against the JLC 2-layer aiee_clearance_floor of 0.127mm. Restoring the vendor's 0.60mm width (RECOMMEND P.C.B LAYOUT, '4-0.60' callout) reopens the gap to the vendor's own 0.20mm (librarian P5 fix 2026-08-27).")
